* Save Brewfile - `brew bundle dump --describe --force`
* Enable Clamshell mode - `sudo pmset disablesleep 1`
* Download MP3 using yt-dlp - `yt-dlp -x --audio-format mp3 <URL>`
* List everything globally installed via npm - `npm list -g --depth=0`
* List all Ghostty themes - `ghostty +list-themes`
* Change Stage Manager animation speed - `defaults write com.apple.WindowManager AnimationSpeed -float 1`
